column3:
checked Github; registered and signed in to kaggle; 
checked Microsoft account access,instelled and opened power BI desktop, saved a practice report;
opened Google Colab and tested python; created team repository and timesheet files

Added a revenue column using transaction quantity multiplied by unit price; 
created Category Revenue and Monthly Revenue PivotTables; grouped transaction dates by month and year; 
calculated total revenue; saved and uploaded COFFEE_SHOP_SALES_ANALYSIS.xlsx to GitHub
